 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "names, emails and phones are parallel string lists of length n; account i is processed in index order. It registers when neither emails[i] nor phones[i] is already claimed by a registered account (exact string comparison); registering claims both. An account that fails is a duplicate and claims nothing. Return the indices (0-based, ascending) of the duplicate accounts. names are carried but never compared.",
